clude pending-drop columns from inserts (#7774)\n- fix(cli): keep only the agent name from a versioned AI_AGENT declaration (#7775)\n- fix(consent): stop asking for consent from a policy we failed to fetch (#7766)\n\n## Contributors\n\n- @TheodoreSpeaks\n- @icecrasher321\n- @mzxchandra\n- @waleedlatif1\n\n[View changes on GitHub](https://github.com/simstudioai/sim/compare/v0.8.33...v0.8.34)", "mentions_count": 4}]